OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 5 DEC
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,6,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,7,     Gmusical life in his 80th birthday
OL,8,     Gyear. Today, they discuss new
OL,9,     Gcreative ventures and the
OL,10,     Gsanctuary of home.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GKatie welcomes Barbara Hannigan
OL,13,     GDarius Brubeck and Dave O'Higgins
OL,14,     Gto In Tune.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
