OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 5 DEC
OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GOpera goes to the movies, and
OL,6,     Gmovie music comes to life, as the
OL,7,     GBBC Concert Orchestra and a
OL,8,     Gglittering array of soloists
OL,9,     Gsalute the genius of Puccini.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,11,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,12,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,13,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,14,     GTonight, Laurie Anderson, who
OL,15,     Gbrought the avant-garde into the
OL,16,     Gmainstream in the 1980s.
OL,17,G2200FLate Junction
OL,18,     GPablo Diserens joins Verity Sharp
OL,19,     Gto discuss symphonic landscapes
OL,20,     Gand documenting environmental
OL,21,     Gloss.
